{"book":11,"chapter":3,"rubric":"MODERN FRONTEND / HISTORY / CHAPTER 3","slides":[{"title":"Ten Years of Silence","sub":"Chapter 3 · From ES3 to Yearly Releases","short":"Introduction","main":"For ten years the language stood still, then it began to ship every year.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["ES3 → ES5","ES6","Every year"],"captions":["Ten years passed between ES3 (1999) and ES5 (2009)","In 2015 the sixth edition shipped the whole modern language at once","Since 2015 a new edition ships yearly: ES2016, ES2017, …"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"1999","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"a1","x":70.0,"y":96.0,"text":"ES3","size":10.0},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":110.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":250.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"text":"10 years","tone":"red","size":11.0},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2009","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"b1","x":290.0,"y":96.0,"text":"ES5","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2009","tone":"muted","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"a1","x":90.0,"y":96.0,"text":"ES5","size":10.0},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":130.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2015","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"b1","x":270.0,"y":96.0,"text":"ES2015 = ES6","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"y0","x":64.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2015","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"y1","x":148.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2016","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"y2","x":232.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2017","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"y3","x":316.0,"y":70.0,"w":52.0,"h":22.0,"text":"2018","tone":"green","